      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at the preliminary briefs for the new painkiller launch. We really want to go big with a 'Superior Rapid Action and Patient Comfort' angle to distinguish ourselves from the generics. Looking at the latest clinical data, do you think we have enough support to lean heavily into those two specific claims for the campaign?",
